  "_comment": [
    "Czech strings this gateway writes into manifests. One file per language; the language is the",
    "filename. Kramerius' own values (titles, authors, dates) are never translated — they pass through",
    "under the `none` tag.",
    "",
    "These are defaults bundled in the jar. The gateway also reads IIIF_I18N_DIR at startup, so a",
    "language can be corrected or added without rebuilding the image. A key missing from a language is",
    "simply not emitted for it, so a partial translation degrades instead of breaking.",
    "",
    "More than two languages is not hypothetical: the registry already carries Slovak institutions",
    "(dikda, snk, cvti) and one hosted in Austria (eod). Adding sk.json translates these labels for a",
    "Slovak reader; the values beside them stay in whatever language the catalogue holds them."
  ],
  "_pageTypes": "page.type.* are taken verbatim from the Kramerius web client's own i18n (digitalniknihovna.cz/assets/i18n/cs.json, the page_type namespace), so a canvas label reads exactly as the same page does in Kramerius itself. Do not re-translate them by hand.",
  "seeAlso.mods": "Bibliografický záznam MODS"
}
